WEBVTT

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:02.637
because private capitalism and liberal democracy

00:03:02.637 --> 00:03:04.903
are held sacrosanct.

00:03:04.903 --> 00:03:07.272
But I ask you today, what would you do

00:03:07.272 --> 00:03:09.083
if you had to choose?

00:03:09.083 --> 00:03:10.897
What if you had to choose

00:03:10.897 --> 00:03:13.360
between a roof over your head

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:15.037
and the right to vote?

00:03:15.037 --> 00:03:16.630
Over the last 10 years,

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:20.410
I've had the privilege to travel to over 60 countries,

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:22.615
many of them in the emerging markets,

00:03:22.615 --> 00:03:24.943
in Latin America, Asia,

00:03:24.943 --> 00:03:27.625
and my own continent of Africa.

00:03:27.625 --> 00:03:30.265
I've met with presidents, dissidents,